# IT7027C - Cloud Infrastructure Technology

This repository contains the complete set of course materials for IT7027C - Cloud Infrastructure Technology.

Included in this collection:

- 14 practical lab exercises covering core cloud infrastructure concepts
- One capstone project that integrates learning across the course
- Hands-on activities for cloud architecture, virtualization, networking, security, automation, and monitoring

Use this repository as a reference for lab instructions, configuration examples, and project deliverables throughout the course.